{'symbol': 'AON', 'date': '2021-11-16 15:23:00', 'title': 'HANNAH GREEN WINS THE LPGA TOUR AON RISK REWARD CHALLENGE AND $1 MILLION PRIZE', 'text': 'EQUAL PRIZE RECEIVED BY PGA TOUR WINNER MATTHEW WOLFF IN AUGUST SEASON-LONG COMPETITION REWARDS BOTH LPGA TOUR AND PGA TOUR PLAYER FOR BETTER DECISION MAKING LINK TO HANNAH GREEN PHOTO NAPLES, FLA., NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AON PLC (NYSE: AON), A LEADING GLOBAL PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FIRM, AND THE LPGA TOUR TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HANNAH GREEN HAS WON THE 2021 AON RISK REWARD CHALLENGE TROPHY AND THE $1 MILLION PRIZE.'}